{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把原先支撑自己的力量并不总在、偶尔因疲惫而松动，理解成了力量逐渐减弱。原文强调的是间歇性的疲惫和松动，并未说明支撑力量持续衰退。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把无法再完整接近过去的熟悉感，改写成了不再试图回到过去，将能力上的局限变成了主动放弃尝试。另外，原文的感受重点是疲倦、失重、迷失方向以及对如何继续生活的疑问，并非清醒。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲故事与完整稿基本是同一件事：一个人怀念已经无法成为现实的旧日归属，却不愿让怀念决定当下，而是坚持按自己认可的尺度行动；思念、不安、孤独和疲惫反复出现，短暂的安定与力量也不断消退，最终仍选择继续，只是尚不知道如何长久承受这一切。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4bf34d32-6ea7-481b-84de-01b186c6a535", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T130828089696Z", "elapsed_seconds": 109.359, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T13:10:17.471369+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max"